  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/searchables.png\" alt=\"small_logo\" width=\"12.5%\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin-right:1rem\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/searchables_banner.png\" width=\"60%\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin-right:1rem\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/jaredlll08/searchables/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/jaredlll08/searchables?style=flat-square\" alt=\"GitHub 问题\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/jaredlll08/searchables/blob/1.19.4/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/jaredlll08/searchables?color=3da6e4&style=flat-square\" alt=\"许可证\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Searchables 是一个库模组，提供了辅助方法，允许您根据组件（</span>shape:square color:red<span style=\"font-size:14px\">）搜索和过滤元素，并内置了自动补全功能。</span></p>\n\n<p><span>自动补全效果如下：</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.blamejared.com/searchables_autocomplete.gif\" alt=\"searchables autocomplete\" width=\"813\" height=\"406\"></span></p>\n\n此模组本身不添加任何内容，但可供其他模组调用以优化搜索体验。\n\n如果您希望支持我的模组开发工作，您可以通过 **[![Patreon logo](https://i.imgur.com/CAJuExT.png) Patreon](https://www.patreon.com/jaredlll08)** 成为赞助者。\n\n[![Nodecraft sponsor banner](https://assets.blamejared.com/nodecraft/jared.jpg)](https://nodecraft.com/r/jared)\n\n**本项目由 Nodecraft 赞助。使用代码 [JARED](https://nodecraft.com/r/jared) 可在您的首月服务中享受 30% 折扣！**",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
